# A Century of Hardship (battlefield.century_of_hardship, Mine Shaft #2716): a level 99 Warrior (Ragnarok, Great Sword
# skill 4240, a Bronze Dagger in the bag) with Three Paths current and Louverance 8 (a GM). _0d0: the 32000 menu
# (0,0,0,1). Updates: 0 released; 16 and 4: REQS_NOT_MET (5); 1 (area 1): registered, entered:
# ENTERING_THE_BATTLEFIELD_FOR 7610, MEMBERS_OF_YOUR_PARTY 7384 (6), TIME_LIMIT_FOR_THIS_BATTLE_IS 7387 (30), the 05C
# (2,0,0,1800); onBattlefieldEnter adds the DEATH listener. Perfect Dodge, Invincible and Elemental Sforzo given (GM
# effects: the char lives); the first tick: the battlefield's effects 143 (Level Restriction 99) and 254 (Battlefield
# 736). BUGBBY claimed: in the 3 s ticks onBattlefieldTick's 90% arm starts the command cycle (nextCommandTime now +
# 30-60 s); GetSystemTime moves on wait jst=1 only, so these ticks give no command. The Bronze Dagger equipped (Bugbby
# kept alive); each wait jst=1 + tick passes nextCommandTime: the global timer picks an alive Moblin and
# handleMoblinCommand runs: the Moblin's command line (base + type - 1: Movamuq 7828, Chekochuk 7836, Trikotrak 7844,
# Swipostik 7852) and Bugbby's accept (7859-7864) in that tick. Type 1 disengages Bugbby onto the Moblin's target. Type
# 2 arms heavyWhisk: step 43 Swipostik's 7853 accepted, Bugbby readies (028 category 7) at step 47, Heavy Whisk 358 at
# step 49. Type 3 arms mightyStrikes: step 37 Chekochuk's 7838 accepted, Mighty Strikes 688 at step 41
# (usedMightyStrikes set). A refusal (20%, or Mighty Strikes asked again: step 47's 7838, forceRefusal) arms
# bugbearRefusal and moblinInsult: at the next tick (step 49) Bugbby's 7865/7866 and the Moblin's insult (base + 3,
# 7839), its refusal skill readied at the next tick or the one after and used a tick later (step 49's Goblin Dice: ready
# at 51, 1102 at 53; Goblin Dice 1102-1108, Frypan 1081, Smokebomb 1082, Bomb Toss 591). After each Bomb Toss (steps 61,
# 75, 81) Swipostik.lua's own WEAPONSKILL_STATE_EXIT listener (not this script) shows its table's reaction lines at the
# next tick (steps 63, 77, 83: 02A 7867, 7833, 7849, 7841). The Moblins' spells (Dia, Disease, Blindness, Shock) land on
# the char and the effect rows are re-saved with the moved clock. Ragnarok back on, MOVAMUQ claimed: Movamuq's
# job_special mixin uses Benediction 689 at step 108; at step 112 Movamuq.lua's onMobFight (50% HP) has set
# triggerMoblinCommand and the tick's HP-threshold arm runs handleMoblinCommand: 7828 and Bugbby's 7859. The four
# Moblins killed; a wait jst=1 + tick: no Moblin alive, no command. BUGBBY killed: allDeath sets WON; 32001
# (1,1800,0,238,13: area 1, no record yet, 238 s inside). Finished: the battlefield's onEventFinishWin (XP 1000: war 0
# -> 1000, the Battlefield[736]XP var at the next JST midnight), then Three Paths' Mine Shaft 32001
# (mission.cop.three_paths, C#; battlefieldWin set by the win) moves Louverance 8 to 9. 11 s: 075 (out); 10 s: the
# effects 143 and 254 removed.
